@api = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@csrf = replace-with-token-from-csrf-response
@conversationId = replace-with-created-conversation-id
@runId = replace-with-created-run-id

### Health (no authentication)
GET {{api}}/health

### Fetch CSRF token; retain the ORBIT_SESSION cookie for all following requests.
GET {{api}}/auth/csrf

### First setup only. Set your own password; no default account is shipped.
POST {{api}}/setup
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"username":"researcher","password":"replace-with-your-own-password"}

### Login; fetch /auth/csrf again after success (the token rotates).
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

username=researcher&password=replace-with-your-own-password

### Logged-in user
GET {{api}}/auth/me

### Create a conversation
POST {{api}}/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"title":"我的研究问题"}

### Create a run (keep the same idempotency key when retrying this exact request).
POST {{api}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: replace-with-a-unique-request-id

{"prompt":"如何区分原文事实与研究推断？","documentIds":[],"skillId":"chat"}

### Query state, answer and known token usage
GET {{api}}/runs/{{runId}}

### Replay SSE events; Last-Event-ID takes precedence over the after parameter.
GET {{api}}/runs/{{runId}}/events?after=0
Accept: text/event-stream

### Cancel (does not erase saved events or partial output)
POST {{api}}/runs/{{runId}}/cancel
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Provider capabilities (never returns API keys)
GET {{api}}/providers

### Skill definitions and implementation status
GET {{api}}/skills

### Logout
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Read saved configuration metadata (never returns the API key).
GET {{api}}/settings/model

### Save account-specific model settings. Omit apiKey or leave it blank to keep the saved key.
PUT {{api}}/settings/model
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"baseUrl":"https://api.example.com/v1","model":"your-model-id","apiKey":"","clearApiKey":false,"timeoutSeconds":120,"maxOutputTokens":2048,"includeUsage":false,"tokenParameter":"max_tokens","revision":0}

### Test the saved provider with one short model request (can incur supplier charges).
POST {{api}}/settings/model/test
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Create a custom instruction Skill. Copy the returned id for later calls.
POST {{api}}/skills
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"证据检查","description":"区分事实、推断和待核验内容","instructions":"依次列出研究问题、原文证据、推断与局限；不能编造文献或实验数字。","enabled":true,"revision":0}

### Read saved research preferences. PUT the same shape to update them.
GET {{api}}/settings/preferences

### Explicit Skill: skillId=custom_xxx. Optional model-selected Skills: toolSkillIds=[custom_xxx].
# Replace custom_xxx with an owned, enabled id from /skills. No arbitrary scripts or tools execute.
# The existing conversation run endpoint supports both forms and retains CSRF + Idempotency-Key.
